theme = SubResource("Theme_bqqt6")
text = "You are a scientist who, using a technology
that allows you to visualize people's
unconscious, has to treat his patients by
ordering the different objects in the rooms, so
 that they match from both sides of the mirror.
Once objects are finally sorted, you will have
to perform one last operation across the mirror,
which varies from person to person"
horizontal_alignment = 1

